Title: Breeding Scheme Designer
Version: 2.0.0
Description: A Shiny GUI tool for comparing breeding strategies and calculating
    expected genetic gain using deterministic simulation. Supports multiple
    concurrent scenarios with interactive plotly charts for comparison.
